ay after 11/12. Hmm, so this EXCLUDES the start day (11/12) and counts the next 15 business days starting from 14/12. \n\nSo the recurso count = 15 business days AFTER 11/12, i.e., 14/12 through 03/02. The 11/12 is the inicio (excluded, per art 224 o1: exclude dia do comeco).\n\nSo my dias_uteis_recurso list incorrectly includes 11/12 as a counted day. The actual counted days are the 15: 14/12...03/02. Let me fix the list to start at 14/12, making it 15 items. And update the explicacao to say \"5 days before recess\" (14,15,16,17,18 = 5) which matches. Good.\n\nSo the fix: dias_uteis_recurso should be 15 items starting 14/12.\n\nLet me fix that line.\n","metadata":{"reasoningField":"reasoning"},"time":{"start":1792713437134,"end":1792713481963}}}
