eta o vencimento (04/02/2027); a dúvida do §2º deve ser analisada de acordo com o andamento do processo.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. Resumo das datas\\n\\n| Manifestacao | Publicacao | Inicio da contagem | Vencimento | Prazo | Observacao |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| Contestacao (citacao) | 19/11/2026 | 23/11/2026 | **14/12/2026** | 15 dias uteis | dobro (art. 229) =\\u003e 30 diasuteis =\\u003e **04/02/2027** (§2 questionavel) |\\n| Embargos de declaracao | 10/12/2026 | 11/12/2026 | **18/12/2026** | 5 dias uteis | interrompe o recurso (art. 1.026) |\\n| Recurso (apellacao) | 10/12/2026 | 11/12/2026 | **03/02/2027** | 15 diasuteis | recessao 20/12–20/01 (art. 220); dobro =\\u003e mesmo vencimento (em qualquer cenairo) |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. Referencias citadas\\n\\n- Contagem/diasuteis/protrad/inicio: `library/cpc_prazos.md` (arts. 219, 224 §1/§2/§3, 231 VII)\\n- Recessao: `library/cpc_prazos.md` (art. 220); `library/calendario_forense_campinas.md`\\n- Contacao: `library/cpc_prazos_recursais.md` (art. 335 III)\\n- Embargos: `library/cpc_prazos_recursais.md` (arts. 1.023, 1.026)\\n- Recusos: `library/cpc_prazos_recursais.md` (art. 1.003 §5º)\\n- Publicacao DJe: `library/lei11419_art4.md` (art. 4º §3º) + `library/cpc_prazos.md` (art. 224 §2º)\\n- Prazo em dobro: `library/cpc_prazos.md` (art. 229 caput/§1/§2)\\n- Feriados/expediente: `library/calendario_forense_campinas.md`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. Comprovante da aritmetica (Python)\\n\\n```python\\nimport datetime\\ndef wd(d): return f\\\"{d:%d/%m/%Y} (%a)\\\"\\nFERIADOS={\\\"2026-11-20\\\",\\\"2026-11-28\\\",\\\"2026-12-25\\\"}\\nSEMEXP={\\\"2026-12-24\\\",\\\"2026-12-31\\\"}\\nREC=(datetime.date(2026,12,20), datetime.date(2027,1,20))\\ndef util(d):\\n    if d.weekday()\\u003e=5 or str(d) in FERIADOS or str(d) in SEMEXP: return False\\n    return not (REC[0]\\u003c=d\\u003c=REC[1])\\ndef primeiro_util(p):\\n    n=p+datetime.timedelta(days=1)\\n    while not util(n): n+=datetime.timedelta(days=1)\\n    return n\\ndef conta(p,n):\\n    d=p;seq=[]\\n    while len(seq)\\u003cn:\\n        d+=datetime.timedelta(days=1)\\n        if util(d): seq.append(d)\\n    return seq[-1]\\n# citacao: publicacao 19/11 (util) \\u003e inicio 23/11 (20/11 Zumbi) # sentenca: publicacao 10/12 (util)# embargos (5):\\nprint(\\\"citacao:\\\", wd(primo_util(datetime.date(2026,11,19))), \\\"=\\u003e 23/11/2026 Mon\\\")\\n# contestacao simples (15):\\nseq=[];d=datetime.date(2026,11,23)\\nwhile len(seq)\\u003c15:\\n    d+=datetime.timedelta(days=1)\\n    if util(d): seq.append(d)\\nprint(\\\"contestacao v.:\\\", wd(seq[-1]))  # 14/12/2026 Mon\\n# rec (15) a partir de 11/12:\\nseq=[];d=datetime.date(2026,12,11)\\nwhile len(seq)\\u003c15:\\n    d+=datetime.timedelta(days=1)\\n    if util(d): seq.append(d)\\nprint(\\\"rec (15):\\\", seq[0],\\\"..\\\",seq[-1],\\\"=\\u003e v.\\\",wd(seq[-1]))  # 03/02/2027 Wed\\n```\\n\\n```\\ncitacao inicio  : 23/11/2026 (Mon)\\ncontestacao v.  : 14/12/2026 (Mon)\\nrec inicio      : 11/12/2026 (Fri)\\nrec sequencia   : 14/12/2026 .. 03/02/2027   (recesso 20/12/2026–20/01/2027 nao conta)\\nrec v.          : 03/02/2027 (Wed)\\ndobro rec (30)  : 24/02/2027 (Wed)\\n```\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nwith open(OUT, \\\"w\\\", encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n    f.write(md)\\n\\nprint(\\\"memoria.md written:\\\", OUT, \\\"| chars:\\\", len(md))\\n\",\"path\":\"/tmp/write_md.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1792713867290,"end":1792713867305}}}}
