 Dra. Marília Sampaio (OAB/SP 318.004), **Sampaio Advocacia**, Campinas.\n*(advogados de escritórios distintos)*\n\n\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"===== FILE: email_socio.txt (291 bytes) =====\nDe: Jorge Ferreira (sócio)\nAssunto: prazos\n\nO advogado da Logística Campos disse que, como somos dois réus com advogados diferentes, temos prazo em dobro para tudo. Confere? Me passa as datas de contestação e, agora que saiu a sentença, de recurso. Quero deixar a data no calendário.\n\n\n===== FILE: intimacao_citacao_dje.pdf (14734 bytes) =====\n%PDF-1.7\n%🖤\n5 0 obj\n<</Filter /FlateDecode/Length 1653>>\nstream\nxڭYK��6\f�ϯ�\u001fXG/�\u0001\u0004s(�K�K��\u0006h�ì7�S\nl���ʒ(��<�l��c�F�ȏ����EĿ;\u0019�sA-ۗ��I�\u000e�p}H�ϧ7\u0017����qF�FK��\u000fB�\u0017�5N���瓃\u0015�\u0000�K{�֬^z\u001f�\u0012D}���������p=����/�\u001c��h�*��\",w��~�V%�\u0005�ܩ�x�(*��Y\u0014���-�C�藇�D��D\u0015�\u0010+ha\u0001��/�7�\u001f����\"�\u001a_\u0013�.\u000f��ǷBhw\u0016�\r�Mm��?i�o2\u000f�|����w������Sq���o���K��B�\fҴ\"Ҹ\u0018߫3}c�Ty���\u0005��A6�E�h*N�gyx7EY��\u000e>�(�*��ע�\u000eQ�7lgHZ�@m;$�{���u�I4I��\u0005/��U\u001a\u001c�\u0005r��i�\u0010.y�ٰ���\u0002�Y*?���*�,>\n���TPB2�\u0015c /\u0003J\b�e�,\r,�)����K}��E��\\{<!&���\u0011i����u)c\u0010�����z�WF:}��=�a6��f�lr�&��|��r�E\u0005�bF1��R��O,�n�\u001a+r\u0005L\u0010�e��G��_����t�%�\u001a-�k]�ҢI5P�E#�\"�PG\u000e!\u0003Օڏ-d�\u001e�uŏp`�\u0014E\u001ad\b�#�J\u0000BYf��&��I}��1H�?�EUw�̮T�!���\u0003�\u00107�x*�\u00047f����$@d\u0018�{������c��R)��\u0010�xڈJ�\u0002!�\u0004\u0016\u0016�\u0003؝���@\u0012O�\u0016�@0&���\rU��\u0006m�jC4{��U(k�\u001d�r\u0001��#a�\u001e�,\u0010��Ä+���o��G\u000b����c�x��ص\u0005�&\u001d�D�e�6�\u001aib�[��!�@Z�`\t�n�\nT�x$�B��bW�\u0014�mC*����p~��]c���n9@�5=i\u0012�Rmvdh���\u0017����\u0004\u0012�w޻��\u0006])\u0007c��\u0014\u0005���v\u0018\r���\f[{\u001a�%Q4�!\u0006�\u0015:ь��u+\u0018��\u001eH۰��ˏC_�gvS'�T�טh&6Ln�ߴ\u0016wJI]�����'Z\u001